flowchart LR
    Start([Proposal operation]) --> Operation{"Operation?"}

        Apply["Apply guards<br/>not own task · external visibility<br/>unassigned · deadline open · no duplicate"]
        Process["Process guards<br/>creator/project authority<br/>pending proposal · task unassigned"]
        Withdraw["Withdraw guards<br/>owned proposal · pending status"]

    Operation -->|Apply| Apply
    Operation -->|Approve / reject| Process
    Operation -->|Withdraw| Withdraw
    Apply --> Result{"All guards pass?"}
    Process --> Result
    Withdraw --> Result
    Result -->|Yes| Continue["Continue governed mutation"] --> End([Completed])
    Result -->|No| Reject["Return typed 4xx / not-found error<br/>without changing proposal or task"] --> Unchanged([State unchanged])

